size 100 7
start
keys t
tick 1s
lock hold
write todo.txt other-line
tick 50ms
frame another-message
lock release
event
tick 50ms
keys t
frame still-puts-back
file todo.txt other-line-put-back
write todo.txt todo.txt
event
tick 50ms
keys t
tick 1s
lock hold
write todo.txt other-line
tick 50ms
lock release
tick 1s
frame message-outlives-the-window
keys t
frame not-extended
file todo.txt new-claim
